# Dropkick Bomber: "Other Goblins you control get +1/+1." and "{R}: Until end of turn, another target Goblin you control gains flying
# and 'When this creature deals combat damage, sacrifice it.'" Turn 1: Bot1 pays {2}{R} for the Bomber (2/3, not buffing itself) and
# {1}{R} for a Goblin Assailant (3/3 with the lord; Bot2's own Assailant stays 2/2). Turn 3: targets that are refused (the opponent's
# Goblin, the Bomber itself, a Mox); the first Assailant gets flying (a Goblin can't block it) and is sacrificed once it deals
# combat damage, the Bomber's player taking nothing. A second Assailant given the same ability but not attacked loses it at end of turn
# (turn 4) and attacks safely on turn 5.

